{"id":1111,"chapter_id":1,"scene_id":103,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"走出暗巷，治安局果然就在眼前，可更多暴徒也聚集在这里。","style":3,"background":119,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"敌人数量太多了，这里没有掩护，很难保障局长的安全。","voice":["vo_cgplot_1111002"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":119,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"海拉","content":"他们比之前的还要暴躁。就没有别的支援了吗？治安局难道就只派了一个混蛋黑帮来接你？","voice":["vo_cgplot_1111003"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":119,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"选项","options":["走不通了吗？"],"jump":[5],"style":6,"background":119,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"无需担心，MBCC会支援你们。","voice":["vo_cgplot_1111005"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":11,"background":119,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"11点方向，前进14米，有我们给您准备的<color=#fb9259>支援</color>。","voice":["vo_cgplot_1111006"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":11,"background":119,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"附近有敌人，我们很快就会被发现。","voice":["vo_cgplot_1111007"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":119,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"没关系，只要到达就好，那里的力量能助你们突围。","voice":["vo_cgplot_1111008"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":11,"background":119,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"……明白了，我会争取时间。","voice":["vo_cgplot_1111009"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":119,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"黑帮","content":"*文明*！怎么到处都是，到处都是！*文明礼貌*禁闭者！","voice":["vo_cgplot_1111010"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"speaker":"泰德","content":"快点，他们很快就能突破了。","voice":["vo_cgplot_1111011"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"speaker":"海拉","content":"闭嘴，我在努力找了！装甲车呢？火箭炮呢？！说好的支援在哪里，这里*文明狄斯*只有个垃圾箱！","voice":["vo_cgplot_1111013"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"content":"她气得狠踹了一脚，垃圾箱里竟传出一声闷哼，里面藏着一个被捆起来的……古惑仔扮相的女人。","style":3,"background":100,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"？？","content":"放开我！现在治安官抓人不分黑白吗？我除了送外卖，还做什么了？！","voice":["vo_cgplot_1111015"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"禁闭者S-217，<color=#fb9259>蔻蔻</color>。使用枷锁吧局长，她能成为您的力量。","voice":["vo_cgplot_1111016"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":11,"background":100,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"speaker":"选项","options":["……可她说自己没有犯事儿"],"jump":[17],"style":6,"background":100,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"我们稍后会核实她的背景，在辛迪加找点事由并不是难事。","voice":["vo_cgplot_1111018"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":11,"background":100,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"speaker":"蔻蔻","content":"你*文明用语*——！！","voice":["vo_cgplot_1111019"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_01","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1}]}